{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-01-12 09:00:00', 'title': 'HII ACHIEVES SIGNIFICANT LIGHT-OFF MILESTONE ABOARD GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER\xa0JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125)', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., JAN. 12, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES' (NYSE:HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION RECENTLY ACHIEVED THE AEGIS LIGHT-OFF MILESTONE ON THE NAVY'S FIRST FLIGHT III ARLEIGH BURKE-CLASS GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125). THIS MILESTONE MARKS THE BEGINNING OF COMBAT SYSTEM TESTING AS SHIPBUILDERS READY THE SHIP FOR PROPULSION TESTS AND EVENTUALLY SEA TRIALS."}